@startuml
[*] --> InitialState

InitialState : User interacts with the system

InitialState --> AddRecipe : Add Recipe
InitialState --> SearchRecipe : Search Recipe
InitialState --> SortRecipes : Sort Recipes
InitialState --> FilterRecipes : Filter Recipes

AddRecipe : Recipe added to the system
AddRecipe --> RecipeAdded : Recipe added successfully
RecipeAdded --> AddRecipe : Add another recipe
RecipeAdded --> InitialState : Return to main state

SearchRecipe : Search for a specific recipe
SearchRecipe --> RecipeFound : Recipe found
RecipeFound --> SearchRecipe : Search again
RecipeFound --> InitialState : Return to main state

SortRecipes : Sort recipes by criteria
SortRecipes --> RecipesSorted : Recipes sorted
RecipesSorted --> SortRecipes : Sort again
RecipesSorted --> InitialState : Return to main state

FilterRecipes : Filter recipes by criteria
FilterRecipes --> RecipesFiltered : Recipes filtered
RecipesFiltered --> FilterRecipes : Filter again
RecipesFiltered --> InitialState : Return to main state

[*] <-- FinalState
@enduml
